        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Letherfall, June 27, 1998.</strong><br>A child is found on the shores of a lake. His eyes wide with terror, his body frozen with fear and cold.<br>Not far from him, dozens of lifeless bodies: <strong>Dylan </strong>is the only survivor.<br>The police investigate, secret services intervene, but it’s all in vain — the truth lies buried with the corpses and within the twisted corners of young Dylan’s mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manhattan, 2018</strong><br>Dylan still remembers nothing of that tragic night, but terrible nightmares begin to consume his mind.<br>Relentless. Violent.<br>A voice haunts him in his sleep. Just one sentence, repeated over and over:<br><strong>&quot;Come back to Letherfall.&quot;</strong><br> It sounds like his sister Janie — whose body was the only one never found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by a dark impulse and the guidance of his therapist, Dylan returns to the now-abandoned village. Letherfall is rotten, decayed, silent… but it is not empty.<br><i>Something </i>is there. <i>Something </i>watching. <i>Something </i>that remembers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a disturbing and decaying environment, through distorted memories, inhuman presences, and unspeakable horrors.<br>Survive, uncover the truth — or lose your mind trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Letherfall is waiting for you.</i><strong></strong><br>And this time… <strong>no one gets out.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Letherfall, June 27, 1998.</strong><br>A child is found on the shores of a lake. His eyes wide with terror, his body frozen with fear and cold.<br>Not far from him, dozens of lifeless bodies: <strong>Dylan </strong>is the only survivor.<br>The police investigate, secret services intervene, but it’s all in vain — the truth lies buried with the corpses and within the twisted corners of young Dylan’s mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manhattan, 2018</strong><br>Dylan still remembers nothing of that tragic night, but terrible nightmares begin to consume his mind.<br>Relentless. Violent.<br>A voice haunts him in his sleep. Just one sentence, repeated over and over:<br><strong>&quot;Come back to Letherfall.&quot;</strong><br> It sounds like his sister Janie — whose body was the only one never found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by a dark impulse and the guidance of his therapist, Dylan returns to the now-abandoned village. Letherfall is rotten, decayed, silent… but it is not empty.<br><i>Something </i>is there. <i>Something </i>watching. <i>Something </i>that remembers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a disturbing and decaying environment, through distorted memories, inhuman presences, and unspeakable horrors.<br>Survive, uncover the truth — or lose your mind trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Letherfall is waiting for you.</i><strong></strong><br>And this time… <strong>no one gets out.</strong></p>",
